name: "astralis"
displayName: "Astralis"
description: "
IN DEVELOPMENT, EXPECT BUGS AND UNFINISHED/UNPOLISHED CONTENT!

Astralis is a mod focused on adding a brand new campaign on a planet harboring the same name.

Set in the same universe as Hell Industries (althought not as horribly painful), fight hordes of eldritch AND mechanical horrors alike with your own mechanical horrors!
Overthrow a government, kill god and ravage an entire planet now! (or maybe when the mod is done)

Difficulty: uhhh... it depends...
Content: For now, quite a decent amount. A lot is in store for the future though :3
Sillyness: MAXIMUM
Eldritch Horrors: I'm just getting started!
Quality: uhhh... it depends...
Balancing: What even is that???????
"
subtitle: "[accent]Domus Dei super ungues martyris aedificata est."
repo: novanox4/Astralis
version: 0.3
minGameVersion: 150
hidden: false
hideBrowser: false
author: NV-NX, Haznobrain
